/*
 * Declares the FieldOperatorValue class.
 *
 * FieldOperatorValue is the abstract ancestor of all operator values that
 * perform a field access on an object. Concrete subclasses implement the
 * semantics of accessing a specific kind of field, such as struct fields, tuple
 * elements, class members, enum fields, option contents, closures, futures, or
 * map fields.
 *
 * Field access operators expose a sub-value of an object and may or may not
 * produce an lvalue depending on the underlying type and access rules.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::fields
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/fields.yr
